{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"flax_tall","model_identifier":"flax_tall","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# flax_tall\n\nTall flax (Patch 5): a fuller clump twice the height of wild flax (about 60 u), with side branches and sky-blue flowers; it gives twice as much flax.\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -13..12, y 0..62, z -11..10 units. Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 128 x 128, 1 px per unit, flat pixel-art tones per material.\n- Cubes: 62 (full 50, picked 12).\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `full` (visible by default)\n- `picked`: short cut stubble"},"resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"leaf_stem#5a7a6a","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-6.45318,-0.03333,-2.5],"to":[-5.45318,55.96667,-1.5],"autouv":0,"color":2,"rotation":[0,0,4],"origin":[-5.95318,27.96667,-2],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[8,0,9,56],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[9,0,10,56],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[10,0,11,56],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[11,0,12,56],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[62,65,63,66],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[63,65,64,66],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"85ed6c4d-9e92-e8ec-bc10-2cdeab20a1cf"},{"name":"flat_flower#5a8ad8","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-9.20636,55.26359,-3.3],"to":[-6.60636,56.26359,-0.7],"autouv":0,"color":7,"origin":[-7.90636,55.76359,-2],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[8,64,11,65],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[11,64,14,65],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[14,64,17,65],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[17,64,20,65],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[12,60,15,63],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[15,60,18,63],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"16746bbf-fcf8-f74b-3b64-cd2e053cf961"},{"name":"flat_flowe